WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,450
No pressure to speak

2
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:02,850
Maybe the fat man is right

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:06,050
Leaving one place is just the beginning of entering another

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,710
But now there are two great men left on the field

5
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:11,710
One of them is a roadkiller

6
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:15,400
They will definitely be tempted to take action in these five days.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,660
I can’t see what’s wrong with Liu Shutong these days

8
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:24,870
But often the most normal people may be the deepest ghosts

9
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:27,470
The system checks Liu Shutong’s identity

10
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,470
Verification successful

11
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:48,680
Liu Shutong’s identity is Brother Lin, the thief

12
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,880
Partiality

13
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,480
Could it be that he has fallen in love with this girl?

14
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:56,630
What you said is true

15
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:59,030
You just need to do what I say and understand
